OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of rain will spread
OL,6,Fnortheast this morning, although the
OL,7,Fnorth may remain dry. This afternoon
OL,8,Fwill be cloudy with outbreaks of rain,
OL,9,Foccasionally heavy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FAny rain soon clearing away
OL,12,Fthis evening. Then the rest of the
OL,13,Fnight will be dry across all parts
OL,14,Fwith lengthy clear periods. Chilly
OL,15,Facross Deeside.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FAll parts will have a dry day
OL,18,Fwith some good spells of sunshine.
OL,19,FHigh cloud spilling northeast later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
